  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "ADDED\n- `ShowManageSubscriptions()` shows the store's own subscription management screen: the App Store's sheet inside the app on iOS and Mac Catalyst, the subscription's Google Play page on Android. RevenueCat Android only gained it in 10.18.0, so the wrapper could not offer it on both platforms before. On Android it needs a store-managed subscription and fails with `UnsupportedError` otherwise, which includes every Test Store subscription.\n- `OwnershipType.Assigned` for a purchase the user has through an organization (StoreKit's `assigned` ownership). It was reported as `OwnershipType.Unknown` before.\n\nCHANGED\n- Android uses RevenueCat Android SDK 11.1.0 (binding `Kebechet.Maui.RevenueCat.Android` 11.1.0, was 10.16.1), built on Google Play Billing Library 9.1. Apps now resolve at least `Xamarin.Android.Google.BillingClient` 9.1.0, `Xamarin.AndroidX.Core` 1.19.0, `Xamarin.AndroidX.Activity` 1.13.0, `Xamarin.Kotlin.StdLib` 2.4.0 and `Xamarin.KotlinX.Coroutines.Core` 1.11.0; an app that pins one of them lower has to raise it (NU1605).\n- iOS and Mac Catalyst use RevenueCat iOS SDK 5.102.1 (binding `Kebechet.Maui.RevenueCat.iOS` 5.102.1, was 5.83.1).\n\nNOTE\n- Apart from the additions above, `IRevenueCatBilling` and its DTOs are unchanged. The RevenueCat changes in each range are in the binding release notes: https://www.nuget.org/packages/Kebechet.Maui.RevenueCat.Android/11.1.0 and https://www.nuget.org/packages/Kebechet.Maui.RevenueCat.iOS/5.102.1",
